  "notes": [
    "burn() requires the INVESTED state. The six strategies were ejected (state 3, pool zero) before governance's migration tx set each pool to a new strategy and the state to INVESTED, so that tx re-established the exploitable route (rule 8, custody pointer); deployment is not the latest reset.",
    "The campaign holds two later copycats that repeated the donation loop on residual balances (one also on the USDT strategy); a scan of every pool-token payout from the six strategies found no non-Ladle burn before the anchor.",
    "Loss is the underlying the six new strategies (plus YSUSDT6MMS) paid out, including the attacker's burnDivested redemption of the drained strategy tokens in the ref tx."
